<title>USA: Triple P NV Q1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Triple P NV Q1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(According to US-GAAP, in thousands of Dutch Guilders,</p>
<p>				 except share data)</p>
<p>						     3 months ended</p>
<p>					Mar 31,     Mar 31,     Mar 31,</p>
<p>					   1997	 1997	  1996</p>
<p>					  US$(a)	 NLG	    NLG</p>
<p> TOTAL NET REVENUES		41,848	78,486	91,548</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS)		(2,596)     (4,868)	 2,716</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS) PER SHARE   (0.11)	(0.20)	  0.11</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE COMMON AND</p>
<p>COMMON EQUIVALENT SHARES</p>
<p>				   24,086,845  24,086,845  23,982,751</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) U.S. dollar amounts as of March 31, 1997 are translated solely for convenience at the Noon Buying Rate of NLG 1.8755 to US $1.00</p>
<p>The company said it is engaged in a continuing restructuring program.</p>
